# Card images are served from S3/CloudFront in production — not baked into the Docker image.
# Exception: `backgrounds/` must be in the image so GET /api/deck-backgrounds can readdir() and
# validateBackgroundPath() works on save. (~25 PNGs, small vs. the full card tree.)
